--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project does not include any model weights. Drawing models (SafeTensors
checkpoints, tokenizer files, VAE and LoRA), chat models (.litertlm / .gguf),
and tagging models (.onnx + selected_tags.csv) are obtained by the user and
loaded at runtime; their licensing and terms are governed by their distributors.

The same applies to the tagging/Tagger assets: the ONNX tagger model (.onnx)
and its tag list (selected_tags.csv) are imported by the user and are not
distributed with this project.


